# Case 18 of sf1_plc_v4.script as taught, the whole case: every movej and movel in program order,
# verbatim (targets, a, v, r), the gripper actions as comments. Left out: the Robotiq URCap code,
# the PLC I/O and the waits. The robot enters the case where the previous case left it.
